{
  "name": "animated-icon",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "动态图标 Animated Icon",
  "description": "图标内部路径会随交互运动的 Lucide 动态图标集合。",
  "import": "import { AnimatedIcon } from \"@/components/ui/animated-icon\"",
  "exports": [
    "AnimatedIcon"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "AnimatedIconGlyph",
    "AnimatedIconGlyphProps",
    "AnimatedIconHandle",
    "AnimatedIconProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "npx wui@latest add @wui/animated-icon",
    "shadcn": "npx shadcn@latest add http://localhost:3000/r/animated-icon.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "@animateicons/react"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": []
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "icon",
      "type": "AnimatedIconGlyph",
      "required": true,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Path-animated icon imported from `@animateicons/react/lucide`."
    },
    {
      "name": "label",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Accessible name. Omit it when the icon is purely decorative."
    },
    {
      "name": "ref",
      "type": "Ref<AnimatedIconHandle>",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Imperative playback handle exposed by the animated glyph."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "control": "number"
    },
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "control": "number"
    },
    {
      "name": "isAnimated",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "```tsx\nimport { BellRingIcon, CopyIcon } from \"@animateicons/react/lucide\"\nimport {\n  AirplaneIcon,\n  BrandOpenaiIcon,\n} from \"@/components/ui/animated-icons\"\n\n<BellRingIcon size={24} />\n<CopyIcon size={24} duration={0.7} />\n<AirplaneIcon size={24} />\n<BrandOpenaiIcon size={24} />\n```\n\n每个图标默认在自身悬停时播放。如果交互区域比图标大，例如工具栏按钮或菜单项，可以使用 wui 的 `AnimatedIcon` 统一处理无障碍语义，并通过 ref 让父元素启动动画。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "animated-icon-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/animated-icon.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "http://localhost:3000/docs/components/animated-icon",
  "sourceUrl": "http://localhost:3000/r/animated-icon.json"
}
